`PolicySubmission.Policies.Board.Row265a0f53acbc.policy` at `n = 2048`, both negation methods and both width rules: `ptpWsTD`, `ptpCleanAncD` and
`ptpPeakQubits = 3 n + ptpWsTD + ptpCleanAncD`, each by `decide +kernel`, plus the `ptpQubits` formula; and the
headline instances of `ptp_peak_qubits_exact` / `ptp_peak_qubits_scan`: some circuit following the policy has
framework `qubitCount` at most the stated number. The board's own rule is the exact one. Generated by `gen_numerals.py`
(swap-002 shard S5c).
